FILE_DESCRIPTION(
/* description */ (
'Beam target for the XIAO ESP32-S3 Sense, chassis: slides into an open
UC2 cube, two rigid rails on -x seat on the 45 deg edge chamfers (x, z
); two long flexure arms on +x click into the +x chamfers, two lands o
n -x limit the roll, the stick''s shoulder is the hard stop. Camera bl
ock in a square seat, XIAO from the back, USB-C from the top. Lens tub
e with a jaw and a lock screw for the lens, screwed out of the module.
 PETG, print on the front face, no supports.'),
/* implementation_level */ '2;1');

FILE_NAME(
/* name */ 'PRT - 9040 - CAMTARXIA - V04.stp',
